I caused everything!

1276
01:54:15.791 --> 01:54:20.541
I told her that Meenakshi
must've liked something in him

1277
01:54:20.625 --> 01:54:22.458
or felt something for him.

1278
01:54:23.333 --> 01:54:25.833
She wouldn't have said yes

1279
